The themes in packages/ rebuild the official Slidev themes (https://github.com/slidevjs/themes),
which are licensed under the MIT License:

  Copyright (c) 2021 Slidev.js Team

Original designs (each package also carries its own LICENSE and NOTICE):

- seriph: Anthony Fu (https://github.com/antfu)
- shibainu and bricks: iiiiiiinès (https://github.com/iiiiiiines)
- apple-basic: Jeremy Meissner (https://github.com/JeremyMeissner)
- adev: not a port. It is inspired by angular.dev, the Angular documentation site (MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2010-2026 Google LLC, https://github.com/angular/angular). It is not an official Angular
  theme, and slide.ng is not affiliated with or endorsed by Google or the Angular team. Its own NOTICE
  has the credits, the font licences and the terms for the Angular logo (CC BY 4.0).

What is ported: the layout names and slots, the CSS values, and the font settings. The Angular components are new code. The eleven polygon shapes
of bricks are drawn for slide.ng and share no path data with the originals.

Assets: the images and other assets of the Slidev themes are licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
(non-commercial). None of them was copied or embedded in this repository. Where an original draws a
picture, the port draws its own CSS gradients. Each package README says what is different.

